      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "由条件设 z = 1 + cosθ + i sinθ，θ∈[0,π/2]。则 w = (1+cosθ+ i sinθ)^2 + 2(1+cosθ+ i sinθ) = 3+4cosθ+cos2θ + i(2sinθ+sin2θ)。计算 |w|^2 = (3+4cosθ+cos2θ)^2 + (2sinθ+sin2θ)^2 = 20+24cosθ+8cos2θ = 4(2cosθ+3)(cosθ+1)。令 t = cosθ∈[0,1]，得 f(t)=4(2t+3)(t+1) 在 [0,1] 上递增，t=1 时最大为 20，故 |w|max = √20 = 2√5。",
